[3.462, "o", "\r\naferidor-fone: REFUSED — 'Pagar pedido' matches the payment word 'pagar'.\r\n\r\n  This taps a button that spends money or contacts someone. The human\r\n  approves it, in the moment, or it does not happen.\r\n\r\n  Show the person the cart total, the merchant and the card. If they\r\n  say yes, re-run this exact command with --eu-confirmo.\r\n\r\n"]
